WEBVTT

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.360
<b>Torii</b>

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.360
Wa...

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.280
ter...

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.950
Act your age, would you?

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.870
You'll make yourself sick.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.540
I do it all for my dear, sweet sons!

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.320
Your mom's gotta work!

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:45.270
Don't eat these
until they grow!
Mom

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.900
You really gotta stop 
doing this to yourself.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.990
Yo, old hag. You know this ain't 
even enough to cover your interest.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.120
You piece of—

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.210
Shuuji...

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:22.810
Hey, you brats.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.740
Got a big job for ya.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.650
Do a good job, and you can pay 
off your debt in a month.

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.640
You wanna make things easier 
for your mom, don't ya?

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.680
It's nothin' too hard.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:44.180
You're just gonna get rid 
of a traitor for me.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.330
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.850
Hey, punk!

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.200
Stop!

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.790
Wh-What the hell...

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.270
<i>Just who was that guy?</i>

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:54.010
Yo, I was thinkin' about summer break.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.290
We should go camping.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.470
Camping? Sounds boring.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:02.250
No, apparently, going camping 
with nothing is a thing now.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.300
Iu! You look awesome again in this one!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.090
Thanks.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.580
Oh, let me see!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.010
I wanna see, too.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:13.190
<b>Enjoying my youth in the tennis club!</b>

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:13.190
<b>I wanna be
a girl like Iu!</b>

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:13.190
<b>All About
the Puchi Model Life</b>

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:13.190
<b>Shindou
Iu</b>

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.340
Damn, you look seriously cute!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:13.170
Your cuteness is just devilish, Iu!

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.070
Your legs are so long.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:15.930
Kusue!

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.560
Hey, did you see that girl the other day?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.980
I did. She was totally copying Iu.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:19.980
See you later.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.950
I can't blame her, though. 
Iu's just so damn popular.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:22.330
Yeah. See you.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.720
Shindou and... Hakozaki?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.240
Were they friends before?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.730
They don't seem to have much in common.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:35.250
I mean, it's the girl at 
the top of the class...

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.000
and the one in the shadows.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.930
They're way too different.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.150
<i>They may be different,</i>

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.390
<i>but they both have a deep-rooted strength.</i>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.650
<b>Who will you use Healing Dust on?</b>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.650
<b>Warrior</b>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.650
<b>Wizard</b>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.650
<b>Hunter</b>

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.390
<i>Is that why they were chosen?</i>

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.090
<i>Maybe not.</i>

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.300
<i>I mean, Tokitate-san was chosen, too.</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.490
<b>HS Girl Yukarion's</b>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.490
<b>Experience with Another World</b>

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.290
<i>Every time we complete a quest, 
we gain one party member.</i>

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.030
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 50 100 l 0 100

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.030
m 0 0 l 30 0 l 30 80 l 0 80

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.030
<b>A
task
we
have
to
carry
out!</b>

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.030
<b>Q
u
e
s
t</b>

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:09.800
This'll create a buzz for sure!

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.030
<i>In the end, there'll be ten members...</i>

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.220
Only four people in the world have 
experienced this, after all!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.080
Oh, but...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.950
There'll be one more soon, right?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.800
Can't wait♥

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.800
Read

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.800
Today

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.800
Yuusuke

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.800
I met the fifth

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
Kusue

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
What were they like?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
Iu

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
What's their name?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
Boy or girl?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.760
Read

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Iu

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
What's their name?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Boy or girl?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Read

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Yuusuke

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Scum

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.220
They're kinda bombing my phone now...

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.020
Yukarion

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.020
What kind of scum?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.020
Iu

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.020
It's been a week since the mission, 
hasn't it?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:35.520
<i>No...</i>

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.220
<i>I guess they can all feel it, too.</i>

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.670
<i>They know we're about to be 
sent to the other world again.</i>

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.850
It's starting?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.290
What the hell?!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.950
What's happening?!

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.630
Damn it, what's going on?!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.590
What the hell is this place?

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.030
He's definitely dangerous.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.030
What is he wearing?

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.350
Wait, what did I do?!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.510
Pleased to meet.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.000
Game Master at your serv.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.940
Your face! Your face!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.150
Your new quest is...

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:40.180
Ta-da! Right he.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.540
<b>Offer the Jiffon Buffo at Väikdamania.
(Time limit: 20 days)</b>

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.540
<b>Quest Time!</b>

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:44.710
"Offer the Jiffon Buffo at Väikdamania"?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.460
More words I don't know...

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.430
Ugh, my revival time is 50 seconds now.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:53.230
A new system's been implemented.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:53.260
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:58.020
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:58.020
<b></b>[Fast Travel]

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:53.300
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:53.350
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:53.430
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:58.020
m 0 0 l 370 0 l 370 248 l 0 248

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:55.330
Fast Travel?

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.000
"Warp to any location you have 
visited at least once before."

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.930
That's standard. Lot of conditions, though.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.720
You guys are too accustomed to this...

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.690
The job of the fifth player, 
Torii Keita, will be...

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.030
Huh?! Job?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.940
What the hell?! What do you mean by "job"?!

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.940
<i>I hope he gets something lame.</i>

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:16.990
Bam!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.480
Warrior (Spear).

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.720
Wh-What's going on?

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:24.290
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.840
Well, see you aga.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:33.710
Why don't we head to Cortonel first 
to find out what the quest is about?

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.530
Shouldn't we explain things 
to Torii-san first?

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:42.200
Once we use Fast Travel, we have to wait 
24 hours before we can use it again.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:46.710
Warping first will save us more 
time than dawdling around here.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:49.400
Huh? I don't think I like 
the way you said that.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:53.040
Our time is more important 
than one person's stress.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:53.820
What?!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.050
Stop!

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.830
Torii-san, I'll only say 
this once, so listen up.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.110
F-Fine.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.380
This is a parallel world, we're heroes,

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.040
and if we don't complete the quest, we die!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.370
That's it!

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.510
Iu-chan, that was a pretty 
rough explanation...

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.500
All right! I don't get it, but I got it!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:15.170
Huh?!

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.280
Look, I'm a middle school dropout.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.590
I don't understand any hard stuff!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.510
A middle school dropout? For real?

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.410
I don't get any of this, 
so I'll just tag along with you.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:28.570
And as for you!

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.600
Let's do this!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.820
This is a pain in the ass...

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.990
Sorry, Yotsuya-kun.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:44.490
He says he won't Fast Travel 
until you do this.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.920
Use that thing! You know, 
the thing that stops movement!

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.770
Are you both ready?

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:54.890
Begin!

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:00.160
On your knees!

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.880
Too easy!

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.120
Ow...

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.140
Looks like I won!

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.870
<i>C'mon, the second one wasn't necessary!</i>

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.760
Wow, we really did make it to Cortonel.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.750
Fast Travel's actually pretty handy.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.480
Kahvel-san should be here.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.910
Let's go see her.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.860
Who's Kahvel?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.330
Someone who helped us on our last quest.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.040
Ah.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.060
We'd been caught by a bunch of bandits.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:04.670
For real?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:07.000
My name's Thecus!

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.590
<i>How much time has passed since 
the last time we were here?</i>

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.770
Great Hero!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.850
Kahvel-san!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.630
It's been a long time, Great Hero.

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.370
About fifteen years.

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:31.920
Fifteen?!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.710
These are my kids.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.030
Aren't they cute?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.050
<i>Sh-She mellowed out!</i>

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:58.750
There's nothing I love more than 
cleaving the flesh of living things!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.070
<i>Fifteen years did a number on her...</i>

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.610
As for the Jiffon Buffo...

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:06.270
Yes? Do you know what it is?

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.280
I don't know about the "Buffo," 
but there's an island called Jiffon.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:13.090
It's famous for its export 
of artisan weapons.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.470
Jiffon is an island?

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.940
Are you still a knight, Kahvel-san?

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.390
I've retired as a knight.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:21.200
Huh?

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:29.560
I lost my right hand in battle.

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:32.760
Fifteen years ago, the Kingdom of Deokk

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:35.620
finally took action to unify the continent.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:42.000
Cortonel formed an allied army with 
other nations to oppose them.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.870
A major war ensued.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:49.170
That battlefield... was hell.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.420
I took part in four campaigns,

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:57.110
but once I had children and learned the 
joy and difficulty of raising them,

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.840
I couldn't do it anymore.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.690
I've grown weak.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.440
<i>Kahvel-san and I were a lot alike.</i>

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.640
<i>We both craved strength.</i>

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:20.080
D-Destroying something... is a hundred 
times easier than creating it, I think.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.380
He's right.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:26.580
I think having kids and raising them is 
thousands of times harder than killing!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:31.310
It's true. So you haven't grown weak at all.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.480
<i>She's changed...</i>

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.980
<i>after experiencing war</i>

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.030
<i>and having children.</i>

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.610
<i>I'll never be able to reach her level.</i>

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.600
I took in a kid once, too.

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.320
I think I was about five.

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.550
My mom suddenly went into labor,

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:58.000
and I raised my little brother 
on my own! Awesome, huh?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.470
What? That's amazing!

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.520
Right?

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.670
Do you have a dad?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.330
Nope. Just my mom.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:08.190
Then a debt collector 
hired me to kill someone.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.210
What? Like, to murder someone?

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.890
Then this guy showed up and helped me escape.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.980
And the debt collector got caught, 
and our whole debt was called off.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.960
O-Oh...

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:21.420
Yotsuya.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.330
I paid you back this afternoon 
for hitting my brother,

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.760
but I'm really grateful for 
what you did last week.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.160
Thanks.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:45.610
<i>I don't have the kind of words 
or strength those people have.</i>

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.740
<i>The truth is, I want to get 
stronger more than any of them.</i>

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.110
I love the view of the sunrise from here.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.480
I wanted to see it with you at the end.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.850
I...

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:17.810
thought I'd never see you again.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.910
Good work. Thanks for everything.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.070
<i>It was a pretty crude goodbye.</i>

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:32.570
<i>I thought we'd see each 
other again soon enough.</i>

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:38.500
I'm sorry I got you involved in that.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:44.180
Bihmsberg wouldn't have died if 
it hadn't been for me, either.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.860
We were so young.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:52.930
In all my life,

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:56.660
I still haven't gone on a 
journey as long as that one.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.980
I think it's because I had my memories 
from it that I survived Hell.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:10.590
Thank you for involving me.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.130
<i>Is that really true?</i>

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:18.430
<i>Was I of any benefit to her?</i>

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:24.610
We were quite a good match, weren't we?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.610
We were pretty similar back then.

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:35.650
Did they tell you what happened while you 
were unconscious from using too much magic?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:36.500
No...

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:41.710
I see... That's a little...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.460
upsetting.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:56.840
I... loved you, Yuusuke.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:05.850
Sorry I went ahead and got old before you.

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:07.800
It's okay...

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:11.480
<i>Hey, Game Master...</i>

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.610
Ready to head back?

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:16.900
Yeah.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.210
<i>What are these quests?</i>

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.330
<i>What is it you're making us do?</i>

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.510
I came to watch because I 
thought it'd be entertaining...

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.490
What a way to have your heart broken.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:34.680
Heroes!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.630
It's been a long time.

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:47.830
I'm Thecus.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.610
My name's Thecus!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:56.990
Everybody, run! I'll buy you some time!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:04.730
Thank you for saving our 
village from that troll.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.180
I-It's so good to see you again.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.100
How have you been?

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.730
Are all the new encounters 
we have in this world...

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.050
once-in-a-lifetime?

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:28.940
m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 210 l 0 210

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:28.940
[The Player's Objective]

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:28.940
• The player's objective is to complete quests
\h\hassigned by the Game Master.
• Upon completion, the player's reward is the
\h\hright to ask the Game Master one question.
• The party gains a new member with each
\h\hquest. When 10 quests are completed,
\h\hthe game is considered conquered.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.390
What an honor.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.570
It's not often we have heroes visit Jiffon.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:41.130
Are you responding to the 
request for mercenaries?

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.320
Mercenaries?

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:45.950
That's not why you're here?

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.460
Ah, there it is.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.220
That's Jiffon Island.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.340
Welcome!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:12.870
We, the ritual dancers 
known as Väikedaam, Yana...

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.790
...and Aoiu...

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:18.960
...welcome y'all mercenaries to our island!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.410
<b>♥ Dear Mercenaries ♥</b>

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.410
<b>Welcome to Jiffon Island!</b>

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:23.240
Uh, er... um...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.840
All we did was tell them 
we're not mercenaries...

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.010
And the mood instantly tanked.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:34.880
Anyway, we need to figure out what 
these weird words in the quest mean.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.380
Excuse me... What is "Väikdamania"?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:41.710
A harvest festival.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.310
And do you know what a "Jiffon Buffo" is?

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.720
Wait, why do we gotta tell 
y'all stuff for free, anyway?!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:48.910
Yeah, yeah!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.870
You two are super cute! 
Wanna go on a date?

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:54.200
Keep quiet. You're gonna complicate things.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.970
What? You mad? Why?

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.150
Because we're not mercenaries!

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.920
Okay, I'll be one of those, then.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:08.180
This here...

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:10.590
...is a Jiffon Buffo!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.410
That turned them around!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.850
Anyway, to finish this quest...

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:20.100
I guess we need to offer one of these cow 
things at the harvest festival, Väikdamania.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.420
We can't have Väikdamania this year.

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:24.440
Huh?

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.630
'Cause of that.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.790
Kumamo Castle.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:38.010
An impregnable castle built by 
our ancestors 400 years ago.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.580
Five years ago, some scary guys 
were shipwrecked here

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.390
and have been occupying it since.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.590
And...

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.740
There they are.

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.720
Orcs.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:51.580
The one at the front is the Orc Queen.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:57.380
The orcs showed up five years ago, 
and war broke out straight away.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.470
But we got our butts kicked.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:04.000
We island folk surrendered to the 
orcs before they could wipe us out,

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.210
but we had 'em figured wrong.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.690
How so?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.320
The orcs weren't fightin' our people.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.600
They were only eatin' us.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.130
Orcs... eat people?

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:20.020
So surrendering wouldn't...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.590
We offered Jiffon Buffo to the 
orcs as an alternate food source.

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:29.530
We became their slaves, breedin' Buffo 
so we wouldn't get eaten ourselves.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.000
In other words, all the 
Buffo belong to the orcs,

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.720
so you can't use them for the 
humans' harvest festival.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:38.450
There are more and more orcs every year.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.380
If they multiply any more, 
there won't be enough Buffo.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.750
And then they'll start eating people again.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:46.300
So the reason you were 
seeking mercenaries was...

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:49.120
To kill them before they kill us.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:52.710
At this year's Väikdamania, in eleven days.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:56.390
We want y'all to kill the orcs, 
starting with the Orc Queen

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.660
when she comes to get the Buffo.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.710
So we just need to beat them?

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.140
That's simple!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:07.890
He's taking it lightly.

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:10.190
But we don't have nearly 
the strength they do.

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.790
To make up for that...

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.700
So what exactly do Väikedaam ritual dancers do?

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.490
We do ceremonial dances 
when the crops are planted

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:21.130
and perform rituals when they're harvested.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.460
Wait, is there anyone else 
who performs these rituals?

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.510
Nope.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:29.940
So the safety of the Väikedaam 
is an added condition?

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:32.010
There's a lot we need to do.

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:37.610
They're gathering mercenaries?

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:38.540
Yes.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.490
Thank you for reporting this to me.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.960
<b>I Know, Let's Go to Jiffon.</b>

